00:00:23.952 --> 00:00:35.083
<v NARRATOR>A young creature was telling a tale, doing beautifully, when suddenly she forgot what came next. Her mind went blank. And she froze.

5
00:00:35.083 --> 00:00:49.534
<v NARRATOR>"And then the... the... um... Sorry. Sorry. I forgot. Um. Let me start over. Sorry." She stared at the ground, and the whole circle squirmed with her.

